    <fr:title text="Nullability in Dependent Lambek Calculus">Nullability in Dependent Lambek Calculus</fr:title>
    <fr:taxon>Definition</fr:taxon>
  </fr:frontmatter>
  <fr:mainmatter>
    <fr:p>The <fr:link href="sss-0014.xml" title="Nullable Grammar" addr="sss-0014" type="local">nullability</fr:link> (<fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[\mathsf {Null}(\cdot )]]></fr:tex>) of a grammar <fr:tex display="inline"><![CDATA[A]]></fr:tex> may be captured in Dependent Lambek Calculus via the following proposition:

  <fr:tex display="block"><![CDATA[ \neg  \mathsf {Null}(A) := A \And  \epsilon  \vdash  \bot ]]></fr:tex></fr:p>
  </fr:mainmatter>
